      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At Arcobaleno, the migration inspector has finished with Elena Pavlovna's kitchen and found nothing wrong. He wants to go somewhere else with his team, and Elena knows exactly where to send him. Listen for the name of the restaurant she suggests.",
      "gap": 0.8
